{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.55:1.1", "PA_thag_1.55:1.2"], "en": "“Having fashioned a small chair and entered the Añjana forest, ... [the verse continues] ...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
